From ffb57836fddcf2de963ae4eea9e822dd6363a887 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 18:09:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: permanently stop agent_cover / PSA-branded outreach
 sends

RepUK dual-campaign cron was still emailing firms as Police Station Agent
(agent_cover_kent_v1). Gate sends at send.ts + runFirmOutreach, send only
whatsapp_invite_v1, remove psa-sync crons, and skip agent-cover probes/kick.
